            <title>[IGNITE-18769] Test CacheMetricsForClusterGroupSelfTest.testMetricsStatisticsEnabled fails</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-18769</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Test &lt;tt&gt;CacheMetricsForClusterGroupSelfTest.testMetricsStatisticsEnabled&lt;/tt&gt; fails due to two reasons:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
